 is designed to cater to your every need.Conveniently located in Downtown Dubai within walking distance to the iconic Dubai Mall, residents can enjoy the perfect blend of urban convenience and sophisticated living. One Residence Apartments for Sale offer exceptional value for the luxury and amenities provided.One Residence boasts incredible amenities designed to enhance your lifestyle, making it the ideal choice for modern living. The concept of 'One' permeates every aspect of the luxurious living experience at One Residence. Here, residents thrive as part of an exclusive inner circle, where each person's contribution enriches the collective experience.","price":1275000,"title":"One Residence","bitrix":{"id":777,"pf_id":"are.2.14044","source":null,"project_id":"One Residence","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"One Residence","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Ginco Properties","project_location":"Downtown Dubai"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_feat_a4b5286590.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_feat_a4b5286590.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1939886,"lng":55.2829413},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_10_5e3bbc32b8.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_10_5e3bbc32b8.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_1_38b542b5d0.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_1_38b542b5d0.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_2_91e7438df4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_2_91e7438df4.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_feat_a4b5286590.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/one_feat_a4b5286590.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/one_10_5e3bbc32b8.webp","464x312":"https://d